{"unit_id":"xubin0628__dsh-task-notifier#card-zh","repo":"xubin0628/dsh-task-notifier","commit":"9ec1935b054406364e34a6fed0abb24741f819f8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-task-notifier 是面向 DSH Web 与桌面端的任务通知插件，会把任务完成、等待批准、等待回答和执行错误显示为应用内横幅、提示音或系统通知。它在宿主侧订阅 DSH 事件并通过事件流把通知送到页面，同时提供设置页控制通知类别、子代理、横幅、音色和音量。任务状态、批准与问题请求分别触发相应提醒，并避免把等待输入误报为完成。适合希望离开窗口时也能留意 DSH 任务进度的用户。无需 API Key 或外部账号；系统通知需浏览器授权，音频播放需页面用户手势。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:252-339","lib/client.js:143-217","assets/notifier-client.js:463-500"]}
{"unit_id":"xubin0628__dsh-task-notifier#card-en","repo":"xubin0628/dsh-task-notifier","commit":"9ec1935b054406364e34a6fed0abb24741f819f8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-task-notifier alerts users to DSH task completion, approval requests, questions, and errors with banners, synthesized sounds, or browser notifications. Its settings page controls event types and sound preferences. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:252-339","lib/client.js:143-217","assets/notifier-client.js:463-500"]}
